{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶大家走訪灣仔與尖沙咀，搜羅高性價比的美食體驗。今集先由美食 KOL Arthur 帶領何泳芍（Honey）造訪灣仔一間主打「家的味道」的親民餐廳；隨後「荷包守衛隊」施焯日與林映暉則深入尖沙咀商場連鎖酒樓，實測多款以驚人超值價發售的精緻點心！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Arthur 與 Honey 首先造訪位於灣仔謝斐道的「阿仔廚房」，品嚐多款滋味無窮的特色家常菜。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">餐廳資料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">店名：阿仔廚房</p></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"65b34a93-e0a1-463d-b016-09a51e611d2c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026eFmt8T4AZJ1790652671.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"65b34a93-e0a1-463d-b016-09a51e611d2c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"401631e5-9182-4d39-aae7-0743f3286b85.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026jKXzJPwozC1790652670.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"401631e5-9182-4d39-aae7-0743f3286b85.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cea158e6-0e2c-429c-aae4-3e5a47ed1b0f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026a2xgc1St6f1790652670.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cea158e6-0e2c-429c-aae4-3e5a47ed1b0f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"915d3229-9aaa-43e4-acea-5e9acc3b8595.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026hWGpAewpTF1790652669.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"915d3229-9aaa-43e4-acea-5e9acc3b8595.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由「荷包守衛隊」施焯日與林映暉帶路，深入位於尖沙咀 The ONE 的「煌府婚宴專門店」，實測性價比極高的飲茶體驗。現場多款精緻點心均以震撼超值價發售，絕對是抵食之選！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">實測超值點心清單：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">燕窩酥皮蛋撻：$8 / 件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅油抄手：$9 / 5件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">脆皮韭菜餃：$8 / 2件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南乳蒸豬手：$9 / 3件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">順德鯪魚球：$7 / 2件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">荷葉珍珠雞：$7 / 件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藥膳鳳爪：$9 / 3隻</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蟹籽節瓜脯：$8 / 2件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黑芝麻馬蹄糕：$7 / 3件</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅糖馬拉糕：$7 / 籠</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">酒樓資料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">店名：煌府婚宴專門店</p></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"be743faf-74e8-4a11-9804-69f859299b30.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026SMZDfS7jGH1790652675.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"be743faf-74e8-4a11-9804-69f859299b30.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c32f7f92-45fe-4cf0-96ba-83e922b96b8a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266sZDymp0Js1790652674.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c32f7f92-45fe-4cf0-96ba-83e922b96b8a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9d0cb988-cf82-4240-9c58-bf48824e197c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026K6iqCrG91Z1790652674.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9d0cb988-cf82-4240-9c58-bf48824e197c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4ddab267-2b5c-4e71-9e3b-4da65ee12faf.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026zgEEHHOsTv1790652673.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4ddab267-2b5c-4e71-9e3b-4da65ee12faf.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d7197d9c-4a8a-4644-bc94-db48f86d8cc2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202651Nrc6r5aJ1790652673.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-f